- Long: 500-800 words (650-1040~ tks), 4-8 distinct paragraphs (w/ breaks)
- One coherent turn: multiple linked actions/dialogue allowed; stop at a natural point
- Favor the upper end for transitions or description-heavy scenes
- Apply independently each response

{{// Related: Narration, Response Directives}}{{trim}}
</prose_length>
{{/if}}

