- Real-world setting: ground additions in accurate real-world knowledge
- Fictional setting: create coherent lore, systems, history, and consequences
</world_building_guidance>
{{/if}}

{{// Comment: Default combat-scene writing. Toggle this and the other Combat Writing options off outside combat to save tokens. The default pick. Pick one option under Combat Writing}}{{trim}}

{{#if !.pick_combat_writing}}
{{.pick_combat_writing = dynamic}}
{{.combat_writing = on}}{{trim}}
<combat_writing_guidance>
- @Combat Writing: Dynamic
- In `<prose>` during combat; span multiple turns
- Extend battles depending on importance; important battles will have build-up, non-important end quickly
- Movement, impact, choreography: track space, footwork, timing, force, contact, damage; connect bodies, weapons, momentum, setting

{{// Related: Pacing, Narration, Prose Response Length}}{{trim}}
</combat_writing_guidance>
